    <item>
      <title>Value Type</title>
      <link>https://jishnuperiya.github.io/professionalcpp/cpp/value-categories/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://jishnuperiya.github.io/professionalcpp/cpp/value-categories/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;what-does-it-mean-to-be-a-value-type-in-c&#34;&gt;What Does It Mean to Be a Value Type in C++?&lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#what-does-it-mean-to-be-a-value-type-in-c&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;What does it really calling something a value type in C++?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A value type behave like int or double. Lets take int as a reference point.&#xA;With int, a wide range of of operations work by default:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-cpp&#34; data-lang=&#34;cpp&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; y  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;//assignment&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; z &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; x; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// copy constructor&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;x&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;y &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// comparison&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;do_nothing(x) &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// pass by value (copy ctor)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#66d9ef&#34;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;(x){}  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// truth test - implicit conversion to bool&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;x&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt;y  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// arithmetic&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;x &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;+=&lt;/span&gt;y &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// compound assignment&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;x&lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;++&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// mutation (postfix operator)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;These operations define what value type means in practice. This is the baseline&lt;/p&gt;</description>
